Package: ImageFeatureTCGA
Title: Import features from hovernet, provgigapath into a MultiAssayExperiment
Version: 0.99.15
Authors@R: c(
    person("Marcel", "Ramos", , "marcel.ramos@sph.cuny.edu", c("aut", "cre"),
        c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3242-0582")
    ),
    person("Ilaria", "Billato", , "ilaria.billato@phd.unipd.it",
        c("aut"), c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3335-3254", 
        affiliation = "Department of Biology, University of Padova")
    ))
Description: The package imports data from hovernet, provgigapath, and
    other feature extraction technologies hosted online. It conveniently
    incorporates these additional data into existing MultiAssayExperiment
    instances from curatedTCGAData. 
Depends: R (>= 4.5.0)
